        "node_id": "n_3_81993f",
        "thought_text": "Transform the problem into a geometric one by considering the reflection of each citizen's home across the line y = x. The optimal 'a' would be such that the median of the y-coordinates of these reflected points aligns with the median of the original y-coordinates.",
